    batch["3 · batches of 512 distinct texts"]:::ingest
    encode["4 · SentenceTransformer.encode<br/>batch 64 · MPS · normalise"]:::ingest
    copy["5 · COPY rows into embeddings<br/>one transaction per batch"]:::ingest
    emb[("embeddings<br/>chunk_id · model · vector")]:::store
    hnsw["6 · build partial HNSW index<br/>per chunk set + model"]:::ingest
    legend["Legend<br/>blue = ingestion · grey = storage"]:::legend

    missing -->|chunk ids + text| reuse
    reuse -->|still missing| dedupe
    dedupe -->|6,812 distinct of 7,411| batch
